WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.470
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.200
Elza, it's too reckless!

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.250
We can't sail in this storm!

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.250
Elza!

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:34.510
I have a dream. And until I achieve it...

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:37.510
I must continue forward at any cost!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.790
Venus Ark has no need for cowards. Disembark if you're too scared.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.790
Now, set sail!

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.030
<i>Elza...</i>

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:03.650
<i>Elza, I...</i>

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:50.730
Fight!

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.400
Yes!

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:56.030
Wrist! Body! Head!

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.950
That was exemplary.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.490
Awesome!

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:10.830
That was so samurai! Very samurai!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:14.590
Rei-chan, you're even better than before!

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:17.590
Thank you.

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:20.220
Nice fight.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.470
Yes!

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:26.140
Elza!

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.600
Morning, Elza.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.180
Good day.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:43.240
Today's morning steak is a cut of Hida beef.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.750
Aria, what do you think?

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.580
It's delicious, very delicious!

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.380
Splendid.

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:00.050
That's a healthy appetite.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:03.680
Good Aikatsu cannot be done without eating properly.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.470
That's true. I'll try to do so myself.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.560
S4 Presents:

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:14.100
It's our job to shine.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.650
First up is Aikatsu Information.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:20.740
We'd like to introduce our viewers to a very special idol today.

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.030
Futaba Aria-chan.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:26.370
She's a very cute girl who came from Finland.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.780
Her interests are singing and flowers.

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:33.660
And on top of all that, she's followed in Hime-chan's footsteps as the muse of My Little Heart.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:35.750
She's no ordinary idol.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.880
Be sure to keep an eye out for Futaba Aria-chan!

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.510
What's that?

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.880
It's an Aikatsu News Flash.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.760
Let's take a look.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.510
Kizaki Rei-san from Venus Ark

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.770
is going to hold a debut show for her new brand!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.230
Is that right?

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.900
It shouldn't be that surprising.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:01.150
Rei-san used to be a popular model in New York.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:06.030
Until one day, when she suddenly vanished from under the spotlight.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:13.660
She's a legendary model nicknamed Shooting Star because of how quickly she flashed through the scene. {somebody is mixing cause and effect}{causality is an illusion anyway}{*boooom*}

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:15.790
That sounds so cool!

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:18.080
What do you think her brand is like?

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.340
Guess we've gotta watch for Rei-san too!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:30.810
Only one left.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:35.310
One more and all the Star Wings will have appeared.

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:39.560
They haven't been assembled yet. It's not perfect.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.190
You never change, Elza.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:46.280
You're strict on both yourself and others, 
and never satisfy easily.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:50.450
Your eyes are always pointed upwards toward perfection.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:54.200
Just like they were back then.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:06:00.670
While everyone else said I was a top model, only you could call me the worst.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:05.920
Do you think I still have a spark inside me?

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:12.010
I can't say. All the talent in the world means nothing if you lack the will to make it shine.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:13.140
You're right.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.940
This is a ticket to my brand reveal.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.900
Please be there.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:24.820
Will there be a performance worthy of my presence?

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:29.280
I'll use all I have in me, with every ounce of my Aikatsu soul.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.830
This will be Rei-san's second debut, right? {I feel like in this instance debut is the wrong word}{I think it fines}

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.420
She's coming off quite the gap. {or whatever}

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:42.080
Her skills are the real deal.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.550
I appreciate the compliment.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.550
Hey.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:49.220
She brought lots of gifts.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.550
It looks delicious!

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:56.140
Be sure to save room for the Japanese desserts.

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.390
I will!

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.940
Rei-san, you're really treating us to all this?

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.360
Of course. Don't feel the need to hold back.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.400
Okay!

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.440
Let's dig in!

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:15.200
Wow, isn't this scrumptious?

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.330
It is!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:21.210
I'm a little bit surprised you brought us sushi and Japanese confections.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:25.710
Really? I had this all the time back in New York. {isn't this cultural appropriation?}{depends on what this is}

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.220
I didn't know you could find Japanese food in New York.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:34.010
What made you bring us all this though?

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.260
As thanks.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:36.220
Thanks?

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:42.730
Because you obtained Star Wings, 
Elza's dream is on the cusp of coming true. {that explains this seating ;_;}

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:43.560
Huh?

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.980
Her dream?

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:47.690
What do you mean?

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.320
You'll find out soon.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.530
In any case, eat up.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.830
Please enjoy, Rei-san.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:58.120
Thank you. What is it? {so is she a japanophile or not? too many contradictiosn}

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:02.540
Green tea. It goes best with Japanese sweets.{something something}

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.970
I see. That's intriguing.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:22.310
This certainly does have an exquisite flavor.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.480
I like it.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:24.980
I'm glad.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:31.490
I had thought I was well and familiar with Japan after practicing kendo and eating Japanese food in New York.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:35.660
There are some things you need to experience firsthand to fully understand.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:39.740
Yes, things I would've never learned had I stayed in New York.

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:42.580
Rei-san, there's something I have to ask.

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.000
Go ahead.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:47.500
Why did you suddenly stop being a model?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.000
I believe I told you about it before.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.970
It's because I met Elza.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:58.050
I gave up on my own radiance after being blinded by Elza's.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:04.310
No, I can't accept that!

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.480
You have so much talent!

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.900
Mahiru-chan...

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.230
If I might ask...

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.280
Why do you all Aikatsu?

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:17.070
I want to be the world's brightest idol.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:20.280
Then I can shine to bring out the brilliance in everyone!

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:23.290
Yeah, I want to see that happen too.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:26.670
It's got to be so that I can see my fans smile.

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:31.750
I'm doing it so that I can touch the hearts of everyone in Japan as a top actress.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:36.220
I originally wanted to surpass my sister...

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:41.060
But now I want to improve for all the fans who support me.

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:47.020
As I thought. The students of Four Star do it for themselves and their fans.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:51.070
I'm sure that's how idols should be.

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.280
But I feel differently.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.610
In what way?

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:56.900
If you're curious...

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.200
Come and see.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:01.870
Watch me perform.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:23.430
Being able to see her again is amazing! {I accidentally capitalized it the first time}

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:26.390
I was so excited I could hardly sleep!

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:29.560
There are a lot of foreign fans here.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:34.190
Yeah, and that's despite her being off the radar for the last few years.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:35.440
It's a full house.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.610
She's got passionate fans!

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.110
It's buzzing in here.{isn't "hype" a more adjective anyway?}

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.030
Yes.

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.370
Yah-ho! Rei-chan, we're coming in.{are we this now? yoohoo is still a thing isn't it}

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.870
Rei-chan, we brought snacks!

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.720
Now, to the stage! {I'll sleep on this}{hey, you didn't let me sleep on this}{because vinyl fell asleep}

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:08.600
Huh?

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.020
What's up?

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.610
I wonder what that seat's for.

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:13.650
Not sure.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:16.570
It appears to be a reserved seat.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.110
In a big way.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:20.950
I wonder who it's for. {nice induced stupidity for all of them here}

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.910
It's a throne!

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:28.000
Yes, it looks like a VIP seat fit for royalty.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:40.130
That's... Elza-san?

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.640
Why's Elza-san the only one to get special seating?

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:50.060
The seats with the best view of the stage are normally designated for fans.

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:54.860
I do not understand what's going through her head.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:12:00.740
More importantly, what kind of show will the legendary Shooting Star be putting on?

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.580
The world is cloaked in darkness.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:14.170
It obscures my sight as the storm obstructs my path.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:22.170
Nonetheless, I will never submit.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.890
I shall slice through the storm with my blade...

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.180
And break through the storm!

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:37.190
My brand bears the name...

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.320
Royal Sword!

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.200
So good!

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.620
Wow...

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.200
Fantastic!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.740
She's so cool!

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:51.700
Yes!

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:03.170
Everyone, welcome to the opening show of Royal Sword. I am Kizaki Rei.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:08.100
For some, this is our first encounter. For others, a long-awaited reunion.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:12.980
In place of my introduction, I would like to answer your questions.

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:19.400
Kizaki Rei-san, you once went on hiatus at the height of your fame.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:20.860
Can you tell us why?

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:24.070
And what made you decide to come back?

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.360
I discovered my purpose.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:28.620
What exactly is it?

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:37.120
If you ask most idols why they Aikatsu, most will say that they wish to shine for themselves or their fans.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:42.670
While I admit that I share some of those feelings, it is not the most important reason for me.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.970
My sole purpose...

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.260
is for Elza.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:57.600
I will be Elza's sword and shield.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:02.110
Royal Sword is a brand made only for Elza.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.150
What?

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.070
What does she mean?

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.110
Right?

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:10.450
You're not here for your fans?

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:14.160
Are you saying you created this brand just for Elza-san?

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:18.500
Yes. Those were my intentions, pure and simple.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.750
Is that true?

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:22.750
Does that mean you don't care about us at all?

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:29.760
It's like a storm.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:35.140
Have any of you ever stood in the face of a storm?

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:41.150
A downpour whips across your face, 
blocking the sight of everything ahead.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:43.230
There's nothing to guide you.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:46.610
No guarantee you'll be able to return safely if you go.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:50.410
Have you ever dived into such a terrifying storm? {I want so badly doven to be a word}{me too, but diven}

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:53.160
It's natural to try to avoid it.{something something religion}

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:56.660
Indeed, I used to be that way.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:00.540
I became a model at the recommendation of others,

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:05.840
walking down a runway prepared for me while crafting fake smiles devoid of joy.

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:11.840
Lacking passion, lacking ambition, 
simply wandering along a paved road.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.930
I had been running from the storm.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:18.850
That is when I met Elza!

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:22.100
Kneeling to nothing, defying all adversity!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:27.940
Seeing her walk unfalteringly toward her goals shook me to my very core!

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:32.780
Her sublime effulgence can be be called nothing but the sun itself!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:41.330
I wish to devote myself entirely to making the sun that is Elza shine ever brighter!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:45.960
That is my will, my passion, and my dream!

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:49.170
I have come to be judged.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:54.390
Are my feelings for Elza right or wrong?

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:59.390
Today, here and now, I ask that the stars and the world make their decision!

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:04.310
The Innocent Prince Coord.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:09.990
I will run the gauntlet in this dress inspired by the noble and beautiful prince.

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:15.450
Kizaki Rei—Everything is for Elza! {I'm up for others like "I devote myself to Elza" or "my everything is for Elza"}{I'm fine with this one}

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:25.390
Yume!

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:28.020
Yeah. Star Wings!

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:32.900
The Uranus Star Premium Rare Coord!

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.860
All nine have been gathered!{I think we've been using it but I don't think "gathered" fits most of the time}{we use appear half the time}

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:38.030
Elza!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:01.680
I've obtained the final Star Wings, Elza.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:06.050
This sort of brand announcement is unprecedented.

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:08.180
You showed not an ounce of restraint.

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:11.730
Do you intend to make an enemy of the world?

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.440
If need be.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:19.030
This is the resolve necessary to keep up with the idol pirate unshaken by storms.{}

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:25.990
Come, Rei.

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:30.330
I will show you the moment my dream is made reality!

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:38.130
Elza, I swear upon my very soul.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.760
I will follow you to the ends of the universe!

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:47.350
Rei-sama!

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:48.600
So valiant!

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:52.930
She's so cool!

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:55.940
Yume-chan.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:21:00.690
Rei-san just shot way up in the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.070
She jumped into fifth!

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:04.490
Amazing!

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:06.110
Nice, Rei-chan!

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:08.990
Incredible! She's very incredible!

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:11.200
So this is Aikatsu too.{there was a fan that looked like ran wasn't there?}{where?}

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:14.540
The two of them know just how to fire me up!

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:17.380
Rei-san is so dazzling!

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:22.760
There are nine total pairs of Star Wings in the world. {well no,it's this}

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.880
The conditions have been met.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:30.390
The Sun Dress will soon appear!

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.600
The Sun Dress?

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:39.480
When all nine Star Premium Rare Coords have gathered, the Sun Dress is certain to emerge.

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:44.990
It will present itself to the idol who shines brightest on stage.

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:51.080
Of the nine possessors of Star Wings, only one can obtain it.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:54.160
That gets me going!

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:56.160
The Sun Dress...

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.040
I would love to don it.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:00.920
Me too!

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:05.550
The Sun Dress... The sun's radiance...

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:09.010
Only Elza is worthy of the Sun Dress.

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:13.430
I will be the one to receive the Sun Dress.

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:17.980
And I will be the world's brightest idol!{does this emphasis really is necessary}

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:19.520
I declare it!

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:58.870
My brand is Royal Sword.

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:03.880
I will grant your wish with my noble and beautiful Innocent Prince Coord.

00:24:03.880 --> 00:24:09.050
I will be the one who gets the Sun Dress and becomes the world's brightest idol.

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:14.050
It's the "Search for S around the city" game!

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:15.640
Wh-What does the "S" stand for?

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:17.510
The S in S4!

00:24:17.510 --> 00:24:19.310
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.310 --> 00:24:21.310
Search for the Splendid S.

00:24:21.310 --> 00:24:23.560
Become the first-star idol!
